  },
  {
   "title": "Size Opposites 📏",
   "text": "Big ↔ small, tall ↔ short, long ↔ short, fat ↔ thin — measurement words flip!",
   "emoji": "📏",
   "bgColor": "from-blue-400 to-indigo-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "Feeling Opposites 😊",
